---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Terms of Use | The Spotted Ape"
  description="Terms for using The Spotted Ape website and its public content."
>
  <article class="editorial-container editorial-container--narrow py-12 sm:py-20">
    <header class="mb-12 border-b border-[var(--border-subtle)] pb-9 sm:mb-16 sm:pb-12">
      <p class="technical-label mb-5 text-[11px] tracking-widest text-[var(--accent-kharos)]">LEGAL / TERMS</p>
      <h1 class="mb-6 text-5xl leading-[0.98] sm:text-7xl">Terms of Use</h1>
      <p class="max-w-[58ch] text-lg leading-8 text-[var(--text-muted)]">
        These terms govern your use of the public website operated by The Spotted Ape (Pty) Ltd.
      </p>
      <p class="technical-label mt-6 text-[11px] tracking-widest text-[var(--text-muted)]">LAST UPDATED / 17 OCTOBER 2026</p>
    </header>

    <div class="space-y-10 text-sm leading-7 text-[var(--text-muted)] sm:space-y-12 sm:text-base sm:leading-8">
      <section>
        <h2 class="font-editorial mb-3 text-2xl text-[var(--text-primary)] sm:text-3xl">1. About these terms</h2>
        <p>The website is operated by The Spotted Ape (Pty) Ltd, registration number 2023/953163/07, Cape Town, South Africa. By using the site, you agree to these terms. If you do not agree, please do not use the site. Separate written terms apply to workshops, advisory work, and other engagements we agree to provide.</p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="mb-3 font-[var(--font-editorial)] text-2xl text-[var(--text-primary)] sm:text-3xl">2. Website content</h2>
        <p>Our articles, frameworks, case studies, and other materials are provided for general information and discussion. They are not legal, financial, employment, cybersecurity, or other professional advice, and do not replace an assessment of your organization and circumstances. You are responsible for decisions made using the material.</p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="mb-3 font-[var(--font-editorial)] text-2xl text-[var(--text-primary)] sm:text-3xl">3. Intellectual property</h2>
        <p>Unless otherwise stated, the website’s original text, visual identity, and frameworks belong to The Spotted Ape (Pty) Ltd or are used with permission. You may access and share links to public pages for personal and internal business reference. Republishing, commercially exploiting, or presenting our materials as your own requires prior written permission. Third-party names and materials remain the property of their respective owners.</p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="mb-3 font-[var(--font-editorial)] text-2xl text-[var(--text-primary)] sm:text-3xl">4. Acceptable use</h2>
        <p>You must not use the website unlawfully, interfere with its operation or security, attempt unauthorized access, or use automated collection in a way that disrupts the service or violates applicable rights. You may link to public pages in a fair and accurate manner that does not imply endorsement or affiliation.</p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="mb-3 font-[var(--font-editorial)] text-2xl text-[var(--text-primary)] sm:text-3xl">5. Availability and external services</h2>
        <p>We aim to keep the website accurate and available, but do not warrant uninterrupted access or that every item is complete or current. Links to services such as Substack are provided for convenience. Those services are operated independently and governed by their own terms and privacy policies.</p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="mb-3 font-[var(--font-editorial)] text-2xl text-[var(--text-primary)] sm:text-3xl">6. Liability</h2>
        <p>To the extent permitted by law, The Spotted Ape (Pty) Ltd is not liable for indirect or consequential loss arising from use of, or inability to use, this public website or reliance on its general information. Nothing in these terms excludes or limits liability or rights that cannot lawfully be excluded or limited under South African law or any other applicable law.</p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="mb-3 font-[var(--font-editorial)] text-2xl text-[var(--text-primary)] sm:text-3xl">7. Privacy and governing law</h2>
        <p>Personal information is handled as described in our <a class="text-[var(--accent-kharos)] underline underline-offset-4" href="/privacy">Privacy Policy</a>, with regard to South Africa’s Protection of Personal Information Act (POPIA) and the GDPR where applicable. These terms are governed by the laws of the Republic of South Africa, subject to mandatory protections that apply in your jurisdiction.</p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="mb-3 font-[var(--font-editorial)] text-2xl text-[var(--text-primary)] sm:text-3xl">8. Contact</h2>
        <p>Questions about these terms may be sent to <a class="text-[var(--accent-kharos)] underline underline-offset-4" href="mailto:contact@spottedape.com">contact@spottedape.com</a>.</p>
      </section>
    </div>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>
